{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTTA HELL</strong> throws you into the afterlife as Mono, a former bank robber now trapped in a corporate purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you\u2019ll need firepower, cunning, and skill. Dive in <strong>guns blazing</strong>, slow down the chaos with <strong>time-bending combat</strong>, or move <strong>tactically through the shadows</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>haunting and ethereal dimensions</strong> filled with deadly foes, from hollow souls to military demons and corrupt CEOs. Tear down the corporations that rule the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down secrets, collect cash, and upgrade your skills and arsenal to become faster, stronger, and deadlier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTTA HELL FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling, brutal combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow Mo - Bullet Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-body movement: slide, combat roll, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and upgrade weapons and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets, collectibles, and cash to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse, immersive environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, ethereal aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hideout hub world to plan your next move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more\u2026</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are a little volcano in the nighttime</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world must burn under your fingertips</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAME\u00a0IS\u00a0IN\u00a0ACTIVE\u00a0DEVELOPMENT,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ALL CONTENT IS SUBJECT TO CHANGE</strong>\u00a0<